{"seq":1,"slug":"oversampling","title":"过采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/oversampling","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"过采样\">过采样</h1><p>把少数类样本复制几份再喂给模型——这是所有不平衡处理里最容易想到、也最容易被想当然用错的一招。它的魅力在于零门槛：不改模型、不改损失，只在数据进入训练之前把少数类&quot;堆多&quot;，让分类器在数量的天平上不再一边倒。但正因为门槛低，它的两个陷阱——过拟合与泄漏——也踩得最频繁。这篇讲清随机过采样到底做了什么、什么时候够用、什么时候会把你带沟里，并交代它与合成采样、代价敏感的分界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把少数类补多\">核心概念：把少数类补多</h2><p>过采样（over-sampling）统一指&quot;增加少数类样本数量&quot;的一类数据层操作。最朴素的形式是随机过采样（Random Over-Sampling, ROS）：从少数类里有放回地随机抽取样本，复制到目标数量，直到类别比例达到期望值。设原始少数类有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个样本、多数类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个，若要把比例调到 1:1，就把少数类复制到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个。整个过程不看特征、不看模型，纯粹是行的复制。</p>\n<p>它与另一条数据层路线——<a href=\"undersampling\">欠采样</a>削减多数类——正好对偶；与合成采样（<a href=\"smote-variants\">SMOTE 及变体</a>造新点）的根本区别在于：ROS 复制的是已存在的样本，不引入任何新信息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  D[原始不平衡训练集] --&gt; S{过采样目标比例}&#10;  S --&gt; R[随机过采样 ROS&lt;br/&gt;有放回复制少数类]&#10;  S --&gt; Syn[合成过采样 SMOTE 系&lt;br/&gt;插值造新样本]&#10;  R --&gt; P1[优点: 简单/无信息损失&lt;br/&gt;缺点: 复制点过拟合]&#10;  Syn --&gt; P2[优点: 增加多样性&lt;br/&gt;缺点: 噪声放大/重叠]&#10;  P1 --&gt; Fit[训练学习器]&#10;  P2 --&gt; Fit&#10;  Fit --&gt; Note[务必只在训练折内做&lt;br/&gt;否则泄漏]\">flowchart TD\n  D[原始不平衡训练集] --&gt; S{过采样目标比例}\n  S --&gt; R[随机过采样 ROS&lt;br/&gt;有放回复制少数类]\n  S --&gt; Syn[合成过采样 SMOTE 系&lt;br/&gt;插值造新样本]\n  R --&gt; P1[优点: 简单/无信息损失&lt;br/&gt;缺点: 复制点过拟合]\n  Syn --&gt; P2[优点: 增加多样性&lt;br/&gt;缺点: 噪声放大/重叠]\n  P1 --&gt; Fit[训练学习器]\n  P2 --&gt; Fit\n  Fit --&gt; Note[务必只在训练折内做&lt;br/&gt;否则泄漏]</pre><p>下表把过采样内部的几种做法摆清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>引入新信息</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机过采样 ROS</td>\n<td>有放回复制少数类</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>复制点过拟合</td>\n<td>快速基线、树模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROS + 平滑</td>\n<td>复制时加微小抖动</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>抖动幅度难定</td>\n<td>缓解精确重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMOTE 系</td>\n<td>近邻插值合成</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>噪声/重叠</td>\n<td>详见<a href=\"smote-variants\">变体篇</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权（等价物）</td>\n<td>少数类损失加权</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需模型支持</td>\n<td>见<a href=\"../algorithm/cost-sensitive\">代价敏感</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"随机过采样为什么会过拟合\">随机过采样为什么会过拟合</h2><p>ROS 的致命弱点，是它把同一个少数类样本一模一样地复制了很多份。对基于间隔或分裂的模型，多份完全相同的点会在特征空间的同一位置形成一个&quot;高密度尖峰&quot;，模型为了正确分类这些重复点，会把决策边界精确地包在它们周围，形成一个个贴合训练样本的小口袋。这在训练集上召回很漂亮，但一旦测试样本稍微偏离，就落在口袋之外被漏判——这就是典型的过拟合。</p>\n<p>用一个直觉来量化：假设少数类里有一个标注错误的离群点，ROS 把它复制了 50 份，那么这个噪声在损失里的话语权也放大了 50 倍，边界会被它硬生生拽过去。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>里&quot;噪声放大&quot;那一节描述的机制。树模型（随机森林、梯度提升）对精确重复相对不敏感，因为分裂点不会因重复而改变位置；但对 KNN、SVM、逻辑回归这类几何模型，ROS 的过拟合风险显著更高。</p>\n<p>一个实践结论：<strong>如果你用的是树模型，ROS 常常还不如直接调 <code>class_weight</code> 省事又稳</strong>；如果非要过采样，也应优先考虑加入多样性的 <a href=\"smote-variants\">SMOTE</a> 而非纯复制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过采样与-加样本权重-的等价\">过采样与&quot;加样本权重&quot;的等价</h2><p>这里有一个贯穿全 hub 的重要认识：把一个样本复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份，和把它在损失函数里的权重乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，对最小化经验风险的优化器来说是等价的。因为总损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i w_i \\ell(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 里，复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 出现了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次，等同于把权重从 1 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。这个等价关系的严格推导放在<a href=\"../algorithm/cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a>，<a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a>也把它作为&quot;数据层与算法层对偶&quot;的核心例子。</p>\n<p>既然等价，实践上就有了一条省事的路：<strong>能调权就别复制</strong>。调权（<code>class_weight=&#39;balanced&#39;</code> 或自定义 <code>sample_weight</code>）不膨胀数据集、不增加内存与训练时间，效果却和纯 ROS 近乎一致。ROS 唯一比调权多出的价值，是当模型不支持样本权重时的兜底，或者需要配合下游只接受&quot;实打实样本&quot;的流程时。反过来，SMOTE 就不在这个等价关系里——它造的是新点，无法用任何权重方案复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-imbalanced-learn-正确地过采样\">用 imbalanced-learn 正确地过采样</h2><p>Python 生态里过采样的标准实现是 imbalanced-learn（imblearn），当前稳定版 0.14.2（2026-06-07 发布）。随机过采样对应 <code>RandomOverSampler</code>，SMOTE 系对应 <code>SMOTE</code> 等。关键不是 API 本身，而是<strong>它必须包在 imblearn 的 <code>Pipeline</code> 里、并且只在交叉验证的训练折上执行</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from imblearn.pipeline import Pipeline&#10;from imblearn.over_sampling import RandomOverSampler&#10;from sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score&#10;&#10;pipe = Pipeline([&#10;    (&quot;ros&quot;, RandomOverSampler(sampling_strategy=0.3, random_state=0)),&#10;    (&quot;clf&quot;, HistGradientBoostingClassifier()),&#10;])&#10;# cross_val_score 会在每个训练折内部才做过采样，验证折保持原始分布&#10;scores = cross_val_score(pipe, X, y, scoring=&quot;average_precision&quot;, cv=5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imblearn.pipeline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imblearn.over_sampling </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomOverSampler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HistGradientBoostingClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_val_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, RandomOverSampler(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sampling_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, HistGradientBoostingClassifier()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cross_val_score 会在每个训练折内部才做过采样，验证折保持原始分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_val_score(pipe, X, y, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"average_precision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个不可妥协的要点。其一，<code>sampling_strategy</code> 不必调到 1:1——把少数类补到多数类的 0.3 倍往往比强行 1:1 更稳，过度过采样会加剧过拟合。其二，也是最致命的：<strong>过采样绝不能在划分交叉验证之前做</strong>。如果先对全量数据 ROS 再切验证折，被复制的少数类样本会同时出现在训练折和验证折里，模型等于&quot;见过答案&quot;，离线指标虚高、上线崩塌。这类数据泄漏是<a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a>的头号主题，务必在动手前读透。用 sklearn 原生 <code>Pipeline</code> 无法承载重采样步骤，必须用 <code>imblearn.pipeline.Pipeline</code>——这也是新手最常犯的错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>过采样统一指增加少数类；随机过采样（ROS）是有放回复制，不引入任何新信息。</li>\n<li>ROS 的核心风险是过拟合与噪声放大：复制点让边界贴合训练样本、把离群噪声的话语权成倍放大，几何模型尤甚。</li>\n<li>复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份等价于把样本权重乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>——因此&quot;能调权就别复制&quot;，纯 ROS 的独特价值仅在模型不支持权重时；严格推导见<a href=\"../algorithm/cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a>。</li>\n<li>用 imbalanced-learn 时必须包进 <code>imblearn.pipeline.Pipeline</code>，过采样只在训练折内做，否则造成<a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">数据泄漏</a>。</li>\n<li>想要多样性而非纯复制，请转向<a href=\"smote-variants\">SMOTE 及变体</a>；想削减多数类，见<a href=\"undersampling\">欠采样</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"undersampling\">欠采样</a> · <a href=\"smote-variants\">SMOTE 及变体</a> · <a href=\"../algorithm/cost-sensitive\">代价敏感学习</a> · <a href=\"../practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a> · <a href=\"../foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../feature-engineering/feature-basics/data-types-encoding\">特征工程 · 数据类型与编码</a> —— 过采样前需先完成编码，含类别特征时纯 ROS 无碍但 SMOTE 需专用变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：imbalanced-learn 0.14.2（2026-06-07 发布，<a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/imbalanced-learn/\">PyPI</a>）在 0.14 中弃用了 SMOTE 系的 <code>n_jobs</code> 参数，改为通过近邻估计器传入，见 <a href=\"https://imbalanced-learn.org/stable/whats_new.html\">Release history</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过采样","id":"过采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把少数类补多","id":"核心概念-把少数类补多"},{"level":2,"text":"随机过采样为什么会过拟合","id":"随机过采样为什么会过拟合"},{"level":2,"text":"过采样与\"加样本权重\"的等价","id":"过采样与-加样本权重-的等价"},{"level":2,"text":"用 imbalanced-learn 正确地过采样","id":"用-imbalanced-learn-正确地过采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"处理谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/foundations/imbalance-spectrum"},"next":{"title":"欠采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/undersampling"}}